    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47141" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sustentācŭlum</span></b> ,
		i, n.
		sustento, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a prop</i>, <i>stay</i>, <i>support.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (post-Aug. and very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sustentaculum, columen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					2, 28</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>sustenance</i>,
				<i>nourishment</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sustentaculum sumptuosum corporis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Mor. Eccl. Cath. 33</span></i>
			.</div>
